Derivation
----------
The source under `web/` is a hardened, curated fork of the upstream project at
commit abc9b686823cbfb4973c79bc36fea37a3244be6c (upstream version 1.6.0, dated
2026-05-08). The fork removes and modifies significant parts of the original
work; changes made by MarketAI are described in web/HARDENING.md and are
themselves distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The upstream project's own NOTICE obligations, trademarks and branding are not
transferred by this derivation. "BoxyHQ" is used here only to identify the
origin of the code.

The pinned upstream identity is recorded in machine-readable form in
web/UPSTREAM.json. There is no automatic upstream rebase; the controlled update
procedure is documented in
docs/architecture/control-plane-fork-boundary.md.
